# Build-root targets for the generation-C torch chain (W2A).
# Resolve with: c_buildroot.py resolve --targets-file tools/buildroot/torch-chain.targets
# NumPy, PyYAML, Pillow and psutil are the W2A gfx1151 builds, so resolve
# with ashp-w2a as a foundation repo. python-triton-gfx1151 is the W2A ROCm
# Triton 3.8 build (#109); AOTriton and PyTorch both build against it.
# python-aotriton-gfx1151 is the W2A AOTriton 0.13b build that PyTorch's
# mem-efficient attention links. rocprofiler-sdk-gfx1151 is what kineto
# links for ROCm profiling (librocprofiler-sdk.so); PyTorch's configure fails
# without it. Its marker headers include rocprofiler-sdk-roctx headers, but the
# package does not depend on rocprofiler-sdk-roctx-gfx1151, so name that too.
